      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"Domovoi\" and Slavic folklore? i'm a bit confused. i'm not really looking for mythological comparisons, i'm just trying to identify a biological pest so i don't lose my whole harvest.\n\ncan you please focus on the agriculture side? you mentioned the spider mite, but you also said the precision might be characteristic of something else. what other specific insects or organisms are known for that kind of extremely precise, almost calculated feeding pattern that leaves no trace behind? i need real names and details for my pest control team.",
